      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i feels like i'm overreacting... doctors always make everything sound so scary. if i just stay off my feet and drink a ton of water, won't the swelling go down? i really don't want to go to the er if i don't have to. what if i just take some acetaminophen instead since you said no to the ibuprofen? would that be okay to just ride it out for the night?",
